    "body": "Related history for the worker: the seam lead logic is crates/motion/src/machining2d/lead_fit.rs. PR #3053 applied a seam-mirror change there for every closed contour, was reverted by #3114 (2026-11-21), and #3019 has a tab-only redo open. Check this symptom against the current law in that file first: a None lead must add no XY lead move at all.\n",
